The MIT license above covers the source code. Bundled third-party assets and
data keep their own licenses:

- webapp/public/models/anatomy/: BodyParts3D, CC BY 4.0; lung meshes
  CC BY-SA 2.1 JP. See webapp/public/models/anatomy/NOTICE.md.
- webapp/public/models/*.json: derived from MakeHuman, CC0.
  See webapp/public/models/MakeHuman-CC0.txt.
- webapp/public/fonts/: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see the *-OFL.txt files).
- webapp/public/brand/google-sign-in.svg: Google brand asset, used under
  Google's sign-in branding guidelines.
- Data snapshots under deploy/ and webapp/public/graph-data/ keep the terms of
  their upstream sources (HPO, Monarch, Orphadata, PubMed/Europe PMC), as
  listed in src/garra/sources/catalog.py.
